    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43a738326f8903668330aa80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是我告诉了气槽，\n一路以来我眼里的她是什么模样……",
      "source_fingerprint": "fba718c2a03d8fdfda4870387f5d39ee8b53cf18e01c0974d4a2c725827070d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ed1f76dad4c4d6f1c76ac37",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "──成为所有赛马娘的“理想”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f568f6025450b2cfa81c9889c5828b36537ce04484620bdc72ebe8276adf182",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5039435e145bf11878c04aa6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "气槽你打从一开始，\n就一直向这个庞大的梦想挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96d84b1370e18d4f28787483a4ba093078ea7654209461c78d074a07f2a9bd80",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:130fa354cb06472872d04912",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让自己无论何时都有“理想”的样子，\n你约束自己，持续向前看──",
      "source_fingerprint": "388cc8f93486a3030c4d0754b7e513497c301827de9d142edea58058bbc9782d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b62b645e9da8053fe4f36719",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有时以学生会副会长的身份带领学园，\n有时则以前辈的身份指导后辈，\n同时，你也在闪耀系列赛中持续奔跑到现在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bf8437fecfa4f4140af70b8799c2f0e5f5b5da08b5dc814b858dfc0d54058c1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb6ae0329bcd33980ae1cd9b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我和学园里的赛马娘们……\n都一直看着这样的你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab38ef07e1c86dd6affafd2be68259f6027c071e1dc778a4b1195ced230a586d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a26c68473ba156c642b6778",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你不是说过要超越铃鹿吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e6623c649ef28a1cd32059a5559acf7c5c279ea654ee1f3652d9a5aa39c2fce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
