    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e7b45b2aafeb977fad19ac6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……这话是，什么意思？",
      "source_fingerprint": "89ed4e370aecf84b1ada798d71ef68f1d3e549275ac586afc28c6f7a1a82a813",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9754f8a849c654c8d476ac43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是“阪神JF”还是三后冠……\n你都不气馁、不放弃，而且从不回头──",
      "source_fingerprint": "a08245db2a35995b736b5fa2e1d1f55b44a4a194d3f26c96442a634d65221367",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        30,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/30/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6aeb1d1cf20ad01a300b26b6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为“女帝”，你带着自豪……\n一路为了实现梦想持续挑战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e49a411a5dd7ae63da0f07816cec85582b891949af9c3687f78e2afc9130d1f7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1d011f3f4ce087ea103ef7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“绝对别松懈。”\n“我要朝更高的目标迈进。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "92796a535fb52eeb19b6965afaeed534d3d8726cd16676bdeec1982de0d3d766",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        32,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/32/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84678af75c7b27875992ba80",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“所以你也要──好好跟上我。”",
      "source_fingerprint": "734134e41412da96abef70ac0139d798ee222de2652737b2ad5f23e9d7828e36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        33,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/33/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1c7693e785a0c7f627c43dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你如此说道，并且不断一关关向前挑战，\n这才是“女帝”气槽。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ae46c4d6dadd6396644eaa4c14cf34c62e66c638e35540916dafdf025d16533",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1018/storytimeline_501018116.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        34,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/34/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c18d5721672acc42353ad0ce",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所有赛马娘都该将你这模样视为理想──\n不屈的“挑战者”模样！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d95dbdcd745cd449f056c8093d54eed43799e7c9a6d68057a1562e5fc82a594e",
